/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (BIS formulates Indian Standards through sectional committees under a Division Council, which are set up to deal with specific group of subjects. The committee structure is designed to bring together all those with substantial interest in a particular field, so that standards are developed keeping in view the balance of interests among the relevant stakeholders)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [12]
>>
